      55.15,
      477.59,
      298.2,
      540.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      555.59,
      298.21,
      670.66
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of below mentioned land, Lot \u2018A\u2019 in total extent of about 0.0167 Hectare, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GM/JAE/2024/97 and dated 03.07.2024, prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys in Gampaha District on behalf of the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Ja-Ela in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 192 of Thudalla West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ja-Ela in Gampaha District in Western Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
