      549.66,
      483.22
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Sekkuwatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0167 Hectare North: The Ja-Ela Divisional Secretariat O\ufb03 ce located at Sekkuwatta and Road (R.D.A.); East: Road (R.D.A.); South: Road (R.D.A.) and Road; West: Road and Lot B.",
